<p>    Total revenues	     $5.3 billion</p>
<p>    Annual passengers	  20 million</p>
<p>    Employees		    21,000</p>
<p>    Cities served		104</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles  12 billion</p>
<p>    Daily departures	   1,050</p>
