<p>NOTE: The figures relate to 1996 full-year results and are in dollars. The totals for Star Alliance results exclude Varig but include express/commuter partner airlines.</p>
<p>The United Airlines cities include 181 United Express partner airline destinations.</p>
<p>The fleet total for Air Canada includes wholly-owned subsidiaries.</p>
